            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 22:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Abaisraeli baacumura omu byabiikiirwe MUKAMA; ahakuba Akani, mwene Karumi, mwijukuru wa Zabudi, mwene Zeera, ow'omu ruganda rwa Yuda, akatwara aha bibiikirwe; MUKAMA yaagirira Abaisraeli ekiniga, kyayaka nk'omuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua yaatuma abantu ari Yeriko kuza Ai haihi na Besaveeni, aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Beseeli, naabagira ati: Mwinamukye mutate egyo nsi. Abashaija abo baagyenda baatata Ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima baagaruka ahari Yoshua, baamugira bati: Abantu boona batazayo, kureka hagyende abantu nk'enkumi ibiri nari ishatu, babe nibo baateera Ai, otaruhiza busha abantu boona, ahabw'okuba abantu baayo ni bakye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 28:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.30.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 30:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo hainamukayo abantu nk'enkumi ishatu; ku baahikireyo, aba Ai baababinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baabaitamu abantu nka makumi ashatu na mukaaga; baabaiha omu maisho g'amarembo gaabo, bababingire baabahitsya Shebariimu, baabaitira aha kashuumo. N'ahabw'ekyo emitima y'abantu yaayaga, yaaba nk'amaizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
