        {
          "text": " Ku ndeebire omu minyago ekijwaro kirungi kya Shinaari na shekeli magana abiri z'efeeza kandi n'omuhimba gw'ezaabu ogwine oburemeezi bwa shekeli makumi ataano, naabyetenga, naabitwara; na mbwenu bisherekire omu itaka, biri omu ihema ryangye ahagati, n'efeeza eri ahansi yaabyo.",
